  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family: Jost;\"><h2 data-path-to-node=\"0\" id=\"isPasted\"><b data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ambassador Affiliate Program: Terms &amp; Conditions</b></h2><p data-path-to-node=\"1\">By participating in the <b data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"24\">RaveBeetle</b> Ambassador Affiliate Program, you agree to the following terms and conditions. These guidelines ensure a fair and transparent partnership for both parties.</p><hr data-path-to-node=\"2\"><h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Commission &amp; Discount Structure</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"4\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ambassador Reward:</b> You will earn a <b data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">10% commission</b> on the net sales price of successful purchases made using your unique referral code.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Follower Discount:</b> Your unique code provides your followers with a <b data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">10% discount</b> on their purchase.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Exclusions:</b> Commissions are calculated based on the product subtotal. <b data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"70\">Taxes and shipping fees</b> are not eligible for commission.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Returns &amp; Refunds</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"6\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Commission Adjustments:</b> If a customer requests a return and receives a refund, the corresponding commission earned from that sale will be deducted from your account balance.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Calculation Example:</b> If a customer receives a <b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"46\">$100 refund</b>, your commission balance will be adjusted by <b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"103\">$10</b> (10% of the refund amount).</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Payment Schedule &amp; Requirements</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"8\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Date:</b> Approved commissions are processed and paid on the <b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"65\">5th of each month</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment Method:</b> All payouts are issued via <b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">PayPal</b>. You are responsible for ensuring your PayPal information is entered correctly in the <a _ngcontent-ng-c1827159108=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" externallink=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2651917987=\"\" jslog=\"197247;track:generic_click,impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_4e200ac8a4f08e9e&quot;,&quot;c_74840db7e0badd18&quot;,null,&quot;rc_d945e34f71e7fc3e&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]\" href=\"https://af.uppromote.com/ravebeetle/login\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" data-hveid=\"0\" decode-data-ved=\"1\" data-ved=\"0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwj_uIHluPCTAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQzAQ\">Affiliate Portal</a>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Missed Payouts:</b> If the automated payment fails due to incorrect PayPal information, the payout will be rolled over to the <b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"122\">5th of the following month</b>.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Commission Approval Process</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"10\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Notifications:</b> You will receive an automated email notification every time your code is used.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Review Period:</b> To account for shipping and potential returns, commissions enter a <b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">5–10 day review period</b> after the customer’s package is marked as <b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"147\">delivered</b>. Once cleared, the commission is marked as \"Approved\" for the next payout cycle.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">5. Tax Obligations (W-9 Requirement)</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"12\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The $550 Threshold:</b> Per US law, we must report earnings over $600 to the IRS. To ensure compliance, we will request a completed <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"128\">Form W-9</b> once your annual earnings reach <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"169\">$550</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Compliance:</b> Providing valid tax information is a requirement for the program. If you decline to complete the W-9 or provide incorrect information, New Blash Corp reserves the right to <b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"180\">deactivate your referral code</b> and pause further commissions until the documentation is submitted.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">6. Code Customization &amp; Promotion</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"14\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Codes:</b> If you would like to personalize your unique promote code, please contact us at <b data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"94\">info@ravebeetle.com</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Content Creation:</b> We encourage you to create original content (videos, photos, reviews) talking about our packs. Authentic engagement is the best way to encourage your followers to use your code.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">7. Termination</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"16\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\">RaveBeetle reserves the right to terminate an Ambassador’s participation at any time for violations of these terms, fraudulent activity, or conduct that misrepresents the brand.</p></li></ul><blockquote data-path-to-node=\"18\"><br></blockquote></div>",
